	"changenote"		"[h2]v0.9.9  (2026-09-22)[/h2]
[h3]中文[/h3]
[list]
[*][b]新增:三种监听方式[/b](「音频与模型设置」里选):
[*][b]按键可以改[/b]:点「修改…」按下想用的键即可;游戏要用的键(F1~F9、数字键、WASD 等)会提示换一个。
[*][b]游戏里能看到开关状态[/b](需伴侣模组):按键模式下每次开/关,顶部横幅和左下角战斗记录都会提示;每次进入战斗也会提醒一次当前是开还是关。
[*]注意:以前'一直监听'下按 F12 临时静音的功能取消了 —— 想随时开关,请改用「按键开关」模式。
[/list]
[h3]English[/h3]
[list]
[*][b]New: three listening modes[/b] (pick one in Audio & Model Setup):
[*][b]Rebind the key[/b]: click 'Change…' and press the key you want; keys the game needs (F1-F9, number keys, WASD…) are rejected with a hint.
[*][b]See the on/off state in-game[/b] (companion mod): in Toggle Key mode every switch shows in the top banner and the bottom-left battle log, and each battle start reminds you whether voice commands are on or off.
[*]Note: the old F12 quick-mute in Always On mode is gone; if you want to switch recognition on and off, use Toggle Key mode.
[/list]"
}
